{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if your Poker hand could save the world? \u2014\u00a0</strong><i>Are you ready to bet a billion souls on a single hand?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038720/extras/5a3eecc7ef42a33a8b60472a79abae2d.webp?t=1769265405\" width=388 height=32 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE POKER-BASED BATTLE SYSTEM \u2014\u00a0</strong>Combine the strategy of Poker with the depth of a full RPG -\u00a0<strong>where smart deck-building and hand manipulation matter more than blind luck</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY \u2014\u00a0</strong>Explore 13 chapters filled with over 200 unique enemies and challenging bosses in a roguelite adventure,\u00a0<strong>where each run challenges your decisions, not just your draw</strong>. (3 chapters available in this demo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEEP CUSTOMIZATION \u2014</strong>\u00a0Collect and upgrade dozens of <i>Battle Mods</i>, weapons, and unique hero skills to <strong>reshape how your cards behave and how every hand plays out</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INFINITE STRATEGIES</strong>\u00a0<strong>\u2014</strong> Customize your Poker deck with different Poker cards and upgrades that synergize with your &quot;Battle Mods&quot;, gears, heroes and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RICH AND MYSTERIOUS WORLD \u2014</strong>\u00a0Explore and uncover the secrets of the Eternal Dreams through unique battles, special encounters, and reality-bending challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add to your WISHLIST</strong> using the green button above to be the first to challenge Eternal Dreams!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Craft Poker combos to activate your heroes' skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038720/extras/57c26707c8e7a49bd83f18a0f6e61831.poster.avif?t=1769265405\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038720/extras/57c26707c8e7a49bd83f18a0f6e61831.webm?t=1769265405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038720/extras/57c26707c8e7a49bd83f18a0f6e61831.mp4?t=1769265405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Battle Mods not dealing you the right cards? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use RAGE to play all the cards and trigger your SUPER ability!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038720/extras/9cc5efb1f54b1d0a053da59faf7eaf5b.poster.avif?t=1769265405\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038720/extras/9cc5efb1f54b1d0a053da59faf7eaf5b.webm?t=1769265405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038720/extras/9cc5efb1f54b1d0a053da59faf7eaf5b.mp4?t=1769265405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Upgrade your card deck along with your gears </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>during numerous unique encounters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img